.TH SDL_ShowNotification 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_ShowNotification \- Show a system notification with normal priority.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_notification.h>
.PP
.BI "SDL_NotificationID SDL_ShowNotification(const char *title, const char *message, SDL_Surface *image, SDL_NotificationAction *actions, int num_actions);
.fi
.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I title
UTF-8 title text, required\[char46]
.TP
.I message
UTF-8 message text, may be NULL\[char46]
.TP
.I image
The image associated with this notification, may be NULL\[char46]
.TP
.I actions
An array of actions to attach to the notification, may be NULL\[char46]
.TP
.I num_actions
The number of actions in the actions array\[char46]
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns A non-zero
.BR SDL_NotificationID
on success or 0 on failure; call
.BR SDL_GetError ()
for more information\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]6\[char46]0\[char46]

